metag: take initial-exec through the GOT for variables of shared libraries

Without -fPIC, initial-exec put the thread pointer offset into the code
(@TLSIENONPIC).  That offset exists at link time only for a variable of the
executable itself.  An executable gets initial-exec for every extern
__thread variable, also for one defined in a shared library, and there the
linker resolved the offset to 0: the program read the TCB instead of the
variable (uClibc-ng's tst-tls-at-ctor, tst-tls10 to tst-tls12).

Load the offset from the GOT, as PIC code does, unless the variable binds
locally.  The prologue sets up the GOT pointer whenever a function uses it,
with or without PIC, and A1LbP is a fixed register.

--- a/gcc/config/metag/metag-linux.c
+++ b/gcc/config/metag/metag-linux.c
@@ -629,8 +629,12 @@
 
       tmp = gen_reg_rtx (Pmode);
 
-      /* Produce different relocations depending on if PIC is enabled or not */
-      if (METAG_FLAG_PIC)
+      /* Produce different relocations depending on if PIC is enabled or not.
+         Without PIC the offset can go into the code only for a variable of
+         this executable; one from a shared library is known only at run
+         time, so load it from the GOT as PIC code does.  The prologue sets
+         up the GOT pointer whenever a function uses it, PIC or not.  */
+      if (METAG_FLAG_PIC || !SYMBOL_REF_LOCAL_P (addr))
         {
           current_function_uses_pic_offset_table = 1;
           emit_insn (gen_tls_ie (tmp, pic_offset_table_rtx, addr));
--- a/gcc/config/metag/tls.md
+++ b/gcc/config/metag/tls.md
@@ -104,12 +104,12 @@
    ""
    [])
 
-;;Initial exec insn for PIC.
+;;Initial exec insn for PIC, and for variables of shared libraries without PIC.
 (define_insn "tls_ie"
   [(set (match_operand:SI                                     0 "metag_reg_nofloat_op" "=da")
         (mem:SI (plus:SI (match_operand:SI                    1 "metag_pic_reg"         "a")
                          (const:SI (unspec [(match_operand:SI 2 "tie_symbolic_operand" "")] UNSPEC_TLSIE)))))]
-  "METAG_HAVE_TLS && METAG_FLAG_PIC && operands[1] == pic_offset_table_rtx"
+  "METAG_HAVE_TLS && operands[1] == pic_offset_table_rtx"
   "GETD\t%0, [A1LbP+#(%c2@TLSIE)]")
 
 ;;Initial exec insns for non-PIC.
